# Python Coding Style

Follow the [Google Python Style Guide](https://google.github.io/styleguide/pyguide.html).

- Line length: 100 characters (project override of Google's 80-char default)
- Type hints on all public functions and methods
- Google-style docstrings on all public modules, classes, and functions
- Run `ruff check` and `mypy` before considering code complete
- No wildcard imports — explicit is better than implicit
